  "name": "Dobos Torte",
  "subtitle": "Layered sponge cake with cocoa filling and crisp caramel",
  "description": "Thin sponge layers are assembled with cocoa buttercream and finished with a smooth caramel layer for a classic multi-layer dessert.",
